        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "LEV.2.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:LEV.2.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he shall bring it to Aaron's sons the priests: and he shall take out of it his handful of its flour, and of its oil, with all its frankincense; and the priest shall burn the memorial of it upon the altar, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an offering made by fire, of a sweet savor to the LORD:",
